erfect square?", "options": ["9", "16", "10", "25"], "answer": "10", "explanation": "9, 16, and 25 are whole numbers multiplied by themselves. 10 lies between 3² and 4².", "sources": ["Derived by integer arithmetic"], "id": "odd-one-out-4", "version": 1}, {"kind": "choice", "prompt": "Which country is outside Asia in this atlas?", "options": ["Nigeria", "India", "Türkiye", "Yemen"], "answer": "Nigeria", "explanation": "Nigeria is grouped in Africa; the other three are in Asia. Classification follows the same atlas as Geography.", "sources": ["https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/africa/ni.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/south-asia/in.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/middle-east/tu.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/middle-east/ym.json"], "id": "odd-one-out-5", "version": 1}]'::jsonb);
