choice", "prompt": "Which country is outside North America in this atlas?", "options": ["Nicaragua", "Saint Vincent and the Grenadines", "Haiti", "Türkiye"], "answer": "Türkiye", "explanation": "Türkiye is grouped in Asia; the other three are in North America. Classification follows the same atlas as Geography.", "sources": ["https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/central-america-n-caribbean/nu.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/central-america-n-caribbean/vc.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/central-america-n-caribbean/ha.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/middle-east/tu.json"], "id": "odd-one-out-9", "version": 1}, {"kind": "choice", "prompt": "Which number is NOT a perfect square?", "options": ["49", "25", "36", "26"], "answer": "26", "explanation": "25, 36, and 49 are whole numbers multiplied by themselves. 26 lies between 5² and 6².", "sources": ["Derived by integer arithmetic"], "id": "odd-one-out-10", "version": 1}]'::jsonb);
