s outside Asia in this atlas?", "options": ["Chile", "Indonesia", "North Korea", "Uzbekistan"], "answer": "Chile", "explanation": "Chile is grouped in South America; the other three are in Asia. Classification follows the same atlas as Geography.", "sources": ["https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/south-america/ci.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/east-n-southeast-asia/id.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/east-n-southeast-asia/kn.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/central-asia/uz.json"], "id": "odd-one-out-14", "version": 1}, {"kind": "choice", "prompt": "Which country is outside Oceania in this atlas?", "options": ["Fiji", "Italy", "Marshall Islands", "Tuvalu"], "answer": "Italy", "explanation": "Italy is grouped in Europe; the other three are in Oceania. Classification follows the same atlas as Geography.", "sources": ["https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/australia-oceania/fj.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/europe/it.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/australia-oceania/rm.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/australia-oceania/tv.json"], "id": "odd-one-out-15", "version": 1}]'::jsonb);
INSERT INTO ledger_private.trivia_packs VALUES ('odd-one-out',3,1,'[{"kind": "choice", "prompt": "Which number is NOT a perfect square?", "options": ["64", "49", "50", "81"], "answer": "50", "explanation": "49, 64, and 81 are whole numbers multiplied by themselves. 50 lies between 7² and 8².", "sources": ["Derived by integer arithmetic"], "id": "odd-one-out-16", "version": 1}, {"kind": "choice", "prompt": "Which country is outside Oceania in this atlas?", "options": ["Federated States of Micronesia", "Vanuatu", "Fiji", "Serbia"], "answer": "Serbia", "explanation": "Serbia is grouped in Europe; the other three are in Oceania. Classification follows the same atlas as Geography.", "sources": ["https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/australia-oceania/fm.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/australia-oceania/nh.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/australia-oceania/fj.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/europe/ri.json"], "id": "odd-one-out-17", "version": 1}, {"kind": "choice", "prompt": "Which country is outside Oceania in this atlas?", "options": ["Fiji", "Honduras", "Tuvalu", "Tonga"], "answer": "Honduras", "explanation": "Honduras is grouped in North America; the other three are in Oceania. Classification follows the same atlas as Geography.", "sources": ["https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/australia-oceania/fj.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/central-america-n-caribbean/ho.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/australia-oceania/tv.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/australia-oceania/tn.json"], "id": "odd-one-out-18", "version": 1}, {"kind": "choice", "prompt": "Which number is NOT a perfect square?", "options": ["65", "81", "100", "64"], "answer": "65", "explanation": "64, 81, and 100 are whole numbers multiplied by themselves. 65 lies between 8² and 9².", "sources": ["Derived by integer arithmetic"], "id": "odd-one-out-19", "version": 1}, {"kind": "choice", "prompt": "Which country is outside North America in this atlas?", "options": ["Chile", "Grenada", "Belize", "Haiti"], "answer": "Chile", "explanation": "Chile is grouped in South America; the other three are in North America. Classification follows the same atlas as Geography.", "sources": ["https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/south-america/ci.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/central-america-n-caribbean/gj.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/central-america-n-caribbean/bh.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/central-america-n-caribbean/ha.json"], "id": "odd-one-out-20", "version": 1}]'::jsonb);
INSERT INTO ledger_private.trivia_packs VALUES ('odd-one-out',4,1,'[{"kind": "choice", "prompt": "Which country is outside Asia in this atlas?", "options": ["Russia", "North Korea", "Mongolia", "Malaysia"], "answer": "Russia", "explanation": "Russia is grouped in Europe; the other three are in Asia. Classification follows the same atlas as Geography.", "sources": ["https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/central-asia/rs.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/east-n-southeast-asia/kn.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/east-n-southeast-asia/mg.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/east-n-southeast-asia/my.json"], "id": "odd-one-out-21", "version": 1}, {"kind": "choice", "prompt": "Which number is NOT a perfect square?", "options": ["100", "82", "121", "81"], "answer": "82", "explanation": "81, 100, and 121 are whole numbers multiplied by themselves. 82 lies between 9² and 10².", "sources": ["Derived by integer arithmetic"], "id": "odd-one-out-22", "version": 1}, {"kind": "choice", "prompt": "Which country is outside Asia in this atlas?", "options": ["Saudi Arabia", "Marshall Islands", "Indonesia", "Sri Lanka"], "answer": "Marshall Islands", "explanation": "Marshall Islands is grouped in Oceania; the other three are in Asia. Classification follows the same atlas as Geography.", "sources": ["https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/middle-east/sa.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/australia-oceania/rm.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/east-n-southeast-asia/id.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/south-asia/ce.json"], "id": "odd-one-out-23", "version": 1}, {"kind": "choice", "prompt": "Which country is outside South America in this atlas?", "options": ["Chile", "Suriname", "Brazil", "Uzbekistan"], "answer": "Uzbekistan", "explanation": "Uzbekistan is grouped in Asia; the other three are in South America. Classification follows the same atlas as Geography.", "sources": ["https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/south-america/ci.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/south-america/ns.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/south-america/br.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/central-asia/uz.json"], "id": "odd-one-out-24", "version": 1}, {"kind": "choice", "prompt": "Which number is NOT a perfect square?", "options": ["121", "100", "144", "101"], "answer": "101", "explanation": "100, 121, and 144 are whole numbers multiplied by themselves. 101 lies between 10² and 11².", "sources": ["Derived by integer arithmetic"], "id": "odd-one-out-25", "version": 1}]'::jsonb);
