try is outside North America in this atlas?", "options": ["Saint Kitts and Nevis", "Guatemala", "Belize", "Rwanda"], "answer": "Rwanda", "explanation": "Rwanda is grouped in Africa; the other three are in North America. Classification follows the same atlas as Geography.", "sources": ["https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/central-america-n-caribbean/sc.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/central-america-n-caribbean/gt.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/central-america-n-caribbean/bh.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/africa/rw.json"], "id": "odd-one-out-39", "version": 1}, {"kind": "choice", "prompt": "Which number is NOT a perfect square?", "options": ["256", "289", "226", "225"], "answer": "226", "explanation": "225, 256, and 289 are whole numbers multiplied by themselves. 226 lies between 15² and 16².", "sources": ["Derived by integer arithmetic"], "id": "odd-one-out-40", "version": 1}]'::jsonb);
