 17².", "sources": ["Derived by integer arithmetic"], "id": "odd-one-out-43", "version": 1}, {"kind": "choice", "prompt": "Which country is outside Europe in this atlas?", "options": ["Benin", "Sweden", "Italy", "Belgium"], "answer": "Benin", "explanation": "Benin is grouped in Africa; the other three are in Europe. Classification follows the same atlas as Geography.", "sources": ["https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/africa/bn.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/europe/sw.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/europe/it.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/europe/be.json"], "id": "odd-one-out-44", "version": 1}, {"kind": "choice", "prompt": "Which country is outside South America in this atlas?", "options": ["Ecuador", "Paraguay", "Saint Kitts and Nevis", "Suriname"], "answer": "Saint Kitts and Nevis", "explanation": "Saint Kitts and Nevis is grouped in North America; the other three are in South America. Classification follows the same atlas as Geography.", "sources": ["https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/south-america/ec.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/south-america/pa.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/central-america-n-caribbean/sc.json", "https://github.com/factbook/factbook.json/blob/144d6977b2b01ac1cbd220de754c0a005616760b/south-america/ns.json"], "id": "odd-one-out-45", "version": 1}]'::jsonb);
